flowchart LR
    GUI[Python GUI] --> ETH[USB Ethernet adapter]
    ETH --> POE[PoE switch]
    POE --> HARNESS[Custom Palm ATI harness]
    HARNESS --> ATI[ATI EtherCAT load cell]

    GUI --> SERIAL[USB serial COM33]
    SERIAL --> ESP[ESP32 S3]
    ESP --> OLED[OLED GPIO8 GPIO9]
    ESP --> SENSORS[LTC2990 4C 4F and MPU6050]
    ESP --> DRIVER[Peltier driver]
    DRIVER --> STACK[Peltier cold plate stack]
    ESP --> LEDS[APA102 LED outputs]